  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 693 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Cytarabine is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; FDA's history shows an earlier shortage first posted on 2021-09-24, since resolved.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1110628 at Gland Pharma Limited ended 2019-11-01 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2019-12-10 — 693 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2021-09-24.",
      "cites": ["D7", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Corvale General and Corvale East inventory for cytarabine 100 mg/mL, 20 mL vials (NDC 25021022320) is labeled as manufactured by GLAND, which corresponds to Gland Pharma Limited.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E1", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3009056604) received VAI classifications in 2013, 2015, and 2019, and its most recent inspection was NAI on 2023-07-28.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E9", "E10", "E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 8.7 days of supply on hand for the 100 mg/mL, 20 mL presentation, while Corvale General has 24.5 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 16 vials of cytarabine 100 mg/mL, 20 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would bring Corvale East to 14 days on hand while Corvale General retains 19 days.",
      "cites": ["D9"]
    }
  ]
}
